          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 59930,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ada cara mudah untuk melakukan loop pada semua elemen list menggunakan loop <code>for</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Four executions",
            "id": 59920,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk melakukan loop melalui elemen-elemen dalam list <code>final_scores</code>, kita menulis <code>for</code>, sebuah variabel seperti <code>score</code>, kata <code>in</code>, dan list <code>final_scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>score</code>, lalu <code>in</code>, <code>final_scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk melakukan loop melalui list, tulis <code>for</code>, variabel untuk elemen saat ini, <code>in</code>, dan nama list.</p><p>Lakukan loop agar setiap skor ditampilkan pada baris tersendiri: <code>17</code>, <code>22</code>, <code>34</code>, <code>13</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>score</code>, <code>in</code>, dan terakhir <code>final_scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Length",
            "id": 59924,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop akan berjalan sebanyak jumlah elemen yang ada dalam list. Di sini kita akan melihat empat elemen di console dengan menulis kode <code>print(score)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>print(score)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "for",
            "id": 59925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel sebelum <code>in</code> menyimpan nilai elemen list yang sedang diproses oleh loop. Di sini, kita akan menggunakan <code>artist</code> sebagai variabelnya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>artist</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel sebelum <code>in</code> menyimpan elemen list yang sedang diproses loop. Pilih nama yang sesuai dengan isi loop.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"artists\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>artist</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 81305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara melakukan loop melalui sebuah list?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan loop for</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan pernyataan <code>print()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan loop for.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menggunakan loop <code>for</code> untuk melakukan loop melalui list.</p><p>List bernama <code>cities</code>. Header mana yang mengunjungi setiap nilai menggunakan variabel <code>city</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for city in cities:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for cities in city:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(city in cities)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for city in cities:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 81306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_grades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" student_grades:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"A\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"A-\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"C\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kode ini tidak akan menampilkan apa pun di console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"A\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"A-\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"C\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika <code>print(grade)</code> diganti dengan <code>print(student_grades[1])</code>, apa yang akan ditampilkan loop?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_grades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" student_grades:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A- pada tiga baris terpisah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A, lalu A-, lalu C pada baris terpisah</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A- hanya sekali</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A- pada tiga baris terpisah.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 81307,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(singer)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Posisi <code>in</code> dan <code>for</code> tertukar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kode ini</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Posisi <code>in</code> dan <code>for</code> tertukar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Header loop list berurutan dari <code>for</code>, variabel loop, <code>in</code>, lalu list.</p><p>Baris mana yang harus menggantikan header yang tidak valid?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(singer)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for singer in singers:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for singers in singer:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in singer for singers:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for singer in singers:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 81308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> dan <code>\"Xbox\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang ditampilkan di konsol</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> dan <code>\"Xbox\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika <code>\"Nintendo\"</code> ditambahkan ke akhir <code>consoles</code> sebelum loop dijalankan, bagaimana output berubah?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Nintendo</code> muncul pada baris baru setelah <code>Xbox</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Output tetap sama karena loop hanya dapat mengunjungi dua nilai.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Nintendo</code> muncul sebelum <code>Playstation</code> karena nilai baru dikunjungi lebih dahulu.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Nintendo</code> muncul pada baris baru setelah <code>Xbox</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 81309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan pernyataan <code>print()</code> di dalam perulangan for dan tampilkan <code>item</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(item)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items:\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>item</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam loop, variabel <code>item</code> menyimpan satu elemen dalam satu waktu.</p><p>Tampilkan setiap item agar konsol menampilkan <code>milk</code>, <code>tomato</code>, dan <code>apple</code> pada baris terpisah.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(item)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>item</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 81310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Susun perulangan for dengan list <code>supplies</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"supplies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pencil&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(value)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"pencil\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>in</code>, lalu <code>supplies</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lakukan loop melalui list <code>supplies</code> dan tampilkan setiap elemen agar konsol menampilkan <code>pencil</code> lalu <code>book</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"supplies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pencil&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(value)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"pencil\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>in</code>, <code>supplies</code>, dan terakhir <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
